Package: cori.data.hu
Type: Package
Title: Access and Analyze Census Bureau Housing Unit Estimates
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Drew", "Rosebush", email = "drew.rosebush@ruralinnovation.us", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Access and analyze U.S. Census Bureau National, State, and County
    Housing Unit Totals from 2020 to present. Provides tools to download
    per-state source files, read processed data from S3, and analyze housing
    stock by geography. Part of the CORI housing supply data ecosystem.
